  <content>
    <section>
      <title>Warm Up Activity</title>
      <note>
      <para>Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos
        guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
      </note>

      <para>Graph each inequality. Adjust the graphing window as needed to show meaningful
        information.</para>

      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <!--QUESTION
          IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
          <para>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \( y &gt;
            x \) using the Desmos tool below.</para>
        <media alt="">
        <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
          height="400" />
        </media>
          <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to
            compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Example:</para>
          <para>\(y &gt; x\)</para>

          
            <media alt="Graph of inequality. ">
              <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_02_01.png" />
            </media>
          

        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Q2-->
  
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <!--QUESTION
          IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
