            compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Example:</para>
          <para>\( y&lt;\text-8 \)</para>

          
            <media alt="Graph of inequality. ">
              <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_02_03.png" />
            </media>
          
        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Q4-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <!--QUESTION
          IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
          <para>Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Graph the inequality \(
            \text-x + 8 \leq y \) using the Desmos tool below.</para>
        <media alt="">
        <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
          height="400" />
        </media>
          <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to
            compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Example:</para>
          <para>\( \text-x + 8 \leq y \)</para>

          
            <media alt="Graph of inequality. ">
              <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_02_04.png" />
            </media>
          

        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Q5-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <!--QUESTION
          IS OUTSIDE OF INTERACTION DUE TO DESMOS-->
